---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Typing speed test';
const description =
  'Practice typing with a built-in passage or your own text, pick a duration and get your words per minute, accuracy and a result card to download or share. Free, no ads, nothing leaves your device.';
const summary = 'Measure your typing speed and get a result card.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={description} tool="typing-test">
  <article class="tool" id="tool">
    <header class="tool__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Typing</p>
      <h1 class="tool__title">{pageTitle}</h1>
      <p class="tool__lead">{summary}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="bench">
      <div class="bench__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="typing-stage">
        <!--
          选择器行（CR-002 / AC-039）：模式、难度（仅内置模式显示）、时长。
          pill 单选：input 覆盖整个 pill（触控区 ≥ 44px），checked 态走兄弟选择器。
          切换不播放任何动效（BR-010）。
        -->
        <div class="selector-row" id="selector-row">
          <div class="selector" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Text source" id="mode-selector">
            <span class="selector__label">Text</span>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="mode" value="built-in" checked />
              <span>Built-in text</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="mode" value="custom" />
              <span>Your text</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="selector" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Difficulty" id="tier-selector">
            <span class="selector__label">Difficulty</span>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="tier" value="easy" checked />
              <span>Easy</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="tier" value="advanced" />
              <span>Advanced</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div
            class="selector"
            role="radiogroup"
            aria-label="Duration in seconds"
            id="duration-selector"
          >
            <span class="selector__label">Seconds</span>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="duration" value="15" />
              <span>15</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="duration" value="30" />
              <span>30</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="duration" value="60" checked />
              <span>60</span>
            </label>
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="duration" value="120" />
              <span>120</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!--
          自定义文本（CR-002 / AC-040 / AC-041）：粘贴框 + 就地报错。
          字号 16px（iOS 底线）；换行与连续空格由 JS 清洗成单空格（BR-005）。
        -->
        <div class="custom-panel" id="custom-panel" hidden>
          <label class="custom-panel__label" for="custom-text">
            Your text
          </label>
          <textarea
            class="custom-textarea"
            id="custom-text"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="Paste the text you want to practice."
          ></textarea>
          <p class="field-error" id="custom-error" hidden role="alert"></p>
        </div>

        <!--
          内置短文（BR-005，CR-002 扩为两档各 5 段）：写在 HTML 里而不是 JS 里——
          词表零 JS 体积，且禁用 JS 时第一段仍然可见（AC-022）。JS 启动后整组隐藏。
        -->
        <div class="typing-passages" id="typing-passages">
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="easy">
            The quickest way to get better at something is to pay attention while you do it. Every
            sentence you type is a small exercise in rhythm and control. Try to keep your eyes on
            the screen instead of the keyboard, and let your fingers find the letters on their own.
            Speed comes later; steady accuracy is what carries you through.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="easy">
            A good morning routine does not have to be long. Ten quiet minutes with a cup of coffee
            and a short list of plans can set the tone for the whole day. The goal is not to fill
            every hour with work. It is to begin with a clear head, one small step at a time, and
            let the rest follow.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="easy">
            Cities change slowly, then all at once. A shop closes, a park opens, a new line appears
            on the map, and one day you notice the street looks nothing like the one you remember.
            Most people miss the middle part of the story. They only see the beginning and the end,
            and they wonder where the years went. It pays to look around.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="easy">
            Learning to cook is mostly learning to read a recipe twice before you start. Get the pan
            warm, chop everything first, and keep the salt within reach. Small habits like these
            turn a stressful evening into a calm one. Nobody cooks well in a rush, and the food
            always knows when you hurried. A calm kitchen is a happy kitchen.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="easy">
            The library was quiet in the way that only rainy afternoons can be. Someone turned a
            page two tables away, the heating hummed against the window, and the light outside
            turned soft and grey. She wrote one sentence, crossed it out, then wrote it again,
            slightly better, and decided that this was enough progress for one day. Rain has that
            effect on people.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="advanced">
            Although the evidence remains inconclusive, several researchers argue that conventional
            explanations overlook the subtle interplay between environment and behaviour. Their
            argument rests on a simple observation: when circumstances shift gradually, people adapt
            without noticing, yet a sudden disruption reveals how fragile those accustomed patterns
            truly were. Critics, meanwhile, caution that replication efforts have produced mixed
            results at best. Whether this holds beyond the laboratory remains an open question.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="advanced">
            The manuscript had been gathering dust in an ordinary cardboard box when the archivist
            recognised the handwriting. Authenticating such documents demands patience: ink
            composition, paper texture and marginal annotations must each be examined under
            magnification. Skepticism is appropriate here, because extraordinary claims require
            extraordinary scrutiny, and the history of discovery is largely a history of elaborate
            forgeries exposed by diligent, unglamorous verification.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="advanced">
            Consider how quickly an unfamiliar neighbourhood becomes ordinary. Within a fortnight
            the awkward detours disappear, the corner shop acquires a name, and the route home no
            longer requires concentration. Psychologists describe this transition as the ordinary
            becoming invisible, yet the process remains remarkably poorly understood. What we
            notice, remember and ultimately inhabit is a fraction of what surrounds us, filtered by
            attention.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="advanced">
            Revenue figures alone seldom explain why a small enterprise thrives while its
            competitors decline. Reliability matters: suppliers who deliver precisely when promised,
            employees who understand the trade thoroughly, and customers who return because the
            experience never surprises them unpleasantly. None of these advantages appears dramatic
            in isolation. Together, accumulated patiently over years, they constitute a defence that
            rivals cannot easily replicate.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage" data-tier="advanced">
            Astronomers spent decades arguing about whether those faint signals originated within
            our galaxy or beyond it. The dispute seemed academic until improved instruments settled
            the matter, revealing a universe considerably stranger than anyone had anticipated.
            Entire categories of objects had simply been invisible. The lesson generalises
            uncomfortably well: our ignorance is rarely a blank space on the map; it is coastline
            drawn confidently in the wrong place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="typing-meta">
          <p class="typing-clock" id="typing-clock" role="timer">
            60
          </p>
          <p class="typing-hint">Seconds left</p>
          <!--
            测试控制按钮贴着打字区（CR-001 / AC-037）：Start / End early / Try again
            三态切换。不与产物按钮放一起——打字是最高频动作，控制它的按钮必须
            就在眼前，点完不用再找输入位置。
          -->
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-variant="primary" id="test-control">
            Start
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="typing-track-wrap">
          <label class="sr-only" for="typing-input">
            Type the text shown below
          </label>
          <div class="typing-track" id="typing-track" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <!--
            原位隐藏输入（2026-09-28 用户裁定，AC-020）：opacity 0 但保留尺寸与
            可聚焦性（不用 display:none，iOS 拒绝对其聚焦），字号 16px 防 iOS
            聚焦放大。点击文本区即点中它。
          -->
          <input
            class="typing-input"
            id="typing-input"
            type="text"
            autocomplete="off"
            autocapitalize="off"
            autocorrect="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            maxlength="400"
            disabled
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <output class="readout" id="readout" data-state="pending" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="readout__label">Your result</p>
        <p class="readout__value" id="readout-value" hidden></p>
        <p class="readout__note" id="readout-note">
          Press Start, then type the text above as carefully as you can.
        </p>
        <canvas class="typing-canvas" id="typing-canvas" hidden></canvas>
      </output>

      <div class="tool__actions">
        <p class="share-note" id="share-note" hidden>
          The link contains your text.
        </p>
        <div class="tool__buttons">
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-variant="primary" id="copy-link" disabled>
            Copy link
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="download-image" disabled>
            Download image
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tool__notes">
      <h2 class="tool__notes-title">How this works</h2>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Pick a passage or paste your own text, choose a duration from 15 to 120 seconds, and press
        Start — the timer begins right away. Type the text you see; wrong characters turn red and
        underlined but never stop you, and backspace works as usual. You can press End early once at
        least 15 seconds have passed — shorter runs are too small a sample to be worth a number.
        Newlines and extra spaces in your own text are collapsed automatically.
      </p>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Your speed is counted the standard way: five characters make one word, backspaced characters
        do not count, and accuracy is the share of characters you got right. Nothing is saved
        anywhere — close the tab and your text and result are gone.
      </p>

      <h2 class="tool__notes-title">Sharing</h2>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Download image saves a result card with a small PlainKit mark in the corner. Copy link puts
        your result into the link itself — anyone who opens it sees the same card. If you practiced
        your own text, the link also carries that text, so anyone who opens it sees exactly what you
        typed. Nothing ever touches a server.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import {
    buildTargetBuffer,
    computeStats,
    CUSTOM_TEXT_MAX_CHARS,
    DEFAULT_DURATION,
    decodeResult,
    diffTyping,
    DURATIONS,
    encodeResult,
    formatResultLabels,
    needsMoreTarget,
    normalizeCustomText,
    ratingFor,
    type SharedResult,
    type TargetBuffer,
    type TypingStats,
  } from '@/lib/tools/typing-test';
  import { drawResultCard } from '@/lib/shared/canvas-card';

  /**
   * 取必填元素；缺失直接抛给顶层 catch 静默降级——页面回到「无 JS 也可读」
   * 的状态，与渐进增强语义一致（DESIGN.md §9.3）。用 throw 而不是一长串
   * `if (!el) return`，是为了让下面所有元素都是非空常量，全文件零非空断言
   * （DESIGN.md §341 禁止 `!`）。
   */
  function requireElement<T extends HTMLElement>(selector: string): T {
    const element = document.querySelector<T>(selector);
    if (element === null) throw new Error(`typing-test: missing element ${selector}`);
    return element;
  }

  function init(): void {
    const passageGroup = requireElement<HTMLDivElement>('#typing-passages');
    const track = requireElement<HTMLDivElement>('#typing-track');
    const input = requireElement<HTMLInputElement>('#typing-input');
    const clock = requireElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('#typing-clock');
    const readout = requireElement<HTMLOutputElement>('#readout');
    const readoutValue = requireElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('#readout-value');
    const note = requireElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('#readout-note');
    const canvas = requireElement<HTMLCanvasElement>('#typing-canvas');
    const control = requireElement<HTMLButtonElement>('#test-control');
    const copyButton = requireElement<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy-link');
    const downloadButton = requireElement<HTMLButtonElement>('#download-image');
    const tierSelector = requireElement<HTMLDivElement>('#tier-selector');
    const customPanel = requireElement<HTMLDivElement>('#custom-panel');
    const textarea = requireElement<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#custom-text');
    const errorLine = requireElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('#custom-error');
    const shareNote = requireElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('#share-note');

    const passageNodes = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLParagraphElement>('.typing-passage');
    if (passageNodes.length === 0) throw new Error('typing-test: no passages in page');

    // 段落来自本页 HTML，按档分组（CR-002 / BR-005）；规范化空白，杜绝源码缩进混进文本。
    const easyPassages: string[] = [];
    const advancedPassages: string[] = [];
    for (const node of passageNodes) {
      const text = (node.textContent ?? '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
      if (node.dataset.tier === 'advanced') advancedPassages.push(text);
      else easyPassages.push(text);
    }
    if (easyPassages.length === 0) throw new Error('typing-test: no easy passages in page');

    type Phase = 'idle' | 'running' | 'done' | 'shared';
    type Mode = 'built-in' | 'custom';
    type Tier = 'easy' | 'advanced';

    let phase: Phase = 'idle';
    /** 当前设置（CR-002）：模式 / 难度 / 时长，均由选择器决定。 */
    let mode: Mode = 'built-in';
    let tier: Tier = 'easy';
    let duration: number = DEFAULT_DURATION;
    /** 自定义模式的清洗后文本；空串表示还没有有效文本。 */
    let customText = '';
    let currentIndex = 0;
    let buffer: TargetBuffer | null = null;
    let spans: HTMLSpanElement[] = [];
    let startedAt = 0;
    let timerId = 0;
    let lastStats: TypingStats | null = null;

    /** 本次测试的目标文本源：内置 = 所选档的 5 段；自定义 = 同一段循环（AC-043）。
     *  自定义源带一个尾随空格：循环拼接处是「dog the」而不是「dogthe」——
     *  短词表反复练时没有这个空格，续打必错。 */
    function currentSource(): readonly string[] {
      if (mode === 'custom') return customText === '' ? [] : [`${customText} `];
      return tier === 'easy' ? easyPassages : advancedPassages;
    }

    function setClock(seconds: number): void {
      clock.textContent = String(seconds);
    }

    /** 把 buffer 渲染成字符 span（无 JS 时该区为空，段落原样可见，AC-022）。 */
    function renderTrack(): void {
      if (!buffer) return;
      const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();
      spans = [];
      for (const character of buffer.text) {
        const span = document.createElement('span');
        span.textContent = character;
        fragment.appendChild(span);
        spans.push(span);
      }
      track.replaceChildren(fragment);
      input.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
    }

    /** 按 diff 刷新着色；光标 = 下一个待打位置。 */
    function paint(diff: { states: string[] }, typedLength: number): void {
      for (const [i, span] of spans.entries()) {
        const state = diff.states[i] ?? 'pending';
        span.classList.toggle('is-correct', state === 'correct');
        span.classList.toggle('is-wrong', state === 'wrong');
        span.classList.toggle('is-cursor', i === typedLength);
      }
    }

    function renderPending(message: string): void {
      readout.setAttribute('data-state', 'pending');
      readoutValue.hidden = true;
      canvas.hidden = true;
      note.hidden = false;
      note.textContent = message;
      copyButton.disabled = true;
      downloadButton.disabled = true;
      updateShareNote();
    }

    /** 隐私提示（CR-002 / AC-045）：自定义模式且卡可见时提醒链接携带全文。 */
    function updateShareNote(): void {
      const settled = phase === 'done' || phase === 'shared';
      shareNote.hidden = !(mode === 'custom' && settled && lastStats !== null);
    }

    /** 预览与导出走同一个 drawResultCard（AC-011 / AC-012 / AC-029）。
     *  画布内部固定 1080×1080（卡片的设计坐标），CSS 负责缩放显示——
     *  drawResultCard 按 1080 布局，内部尺寸若跟随 CSS 宽度会把内容画到画布外
     *  （2026-09-28 浏览器验收实测踩坑）。 */
    function drawCardPreview(): void {
      if (!lastStats) return;
      canvas.width = 1080;
      canvas.height = 1080;
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) return;
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      drawResultCard(ctx, {
        wpm: String(lastStats.wpm),
        unitLabel: 'words per minute',
        detailLabel: labels.detail,
        rating: ratingFor(lastStats.wpm),
      });
    }

    function showResult(stats: TypingStats): void {
      lastStats = stats;
      const labels = formatResultLabels(stats);
      readoutValue.hidden = false;
      readoutValue.textContent = labels.readout;
      note.hidden = false;
      note.textContent = labels.note;
      readout.setAttribute('data-state', 'ok');
      canvas.hidden = false;
      drawCardPreview();

      // 结果首次出现的 180ms 过渡（AC-031）；prefers-reduced-motion 全局兜底。
      readout.classList.add('is-entering');
      window.requestAnimationFrame(() => readout.classList.remove('is-entering'));

      copyButton.disabled = false;
      downloadButton.disabled = false;
      // 分享参数（CR-002 / BR-009）：内置 = 档位 + 序号 + 时长；自定义 = 全文 + 时长
      const shared: SharedResult =
        mode === 'custom'
          ? {
              customText,
              wpm: stats.wpm,
              accuracy: stats.accuracy,
              seconds: stats.seconds,
              duration,
            }
          : {
              textIndex: currentIndex,
              tier,
              wpm: stats.wpm,
              accuracy: stats.accuracy,
              seconds: stats.seconds,
              duration,
            };
      syncUrl(shared);
      updateShareNote();
    }

    /** 把成绩写进地址栏（Copy link 的基础）；离开结果态时清掉。 */
    function syncUrl(result: SharedResult | null): void {
      const url = new URL(window.location.href);
      url.search = result ? encodeResult(result).toString() : '';
      window.history.replaceState(null, '', url);
    }

    function start(): void {
      phase = 'running';
      lastStats = null;
      syncUrl(null);
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(currentSource(), currentIndex, 1);
      renderTrack();
      input.value = '';
      input.disabled = false;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      setClock(duration);
      control.textContent = 'End early';
      renderPending('The timer is running. Press Escape to end early.');
      // 点 Start（或按 Enter）后视口回到打字区，不让用户再手动找输入位置（AC-038）。
      // 默认 instant 滚动——DESIGN.md §6-bis.7 禁滚动动画。
      track.scrollIntoView({ block: 'center' });
      // 焦点跟到输入框（CR-001 用户要求）：disabled 解除后必须显式 focus，
      // 否则焦点留在 Start 按钮上，按 Enter 会立刻触发 End early。
      input.focus();
      startedAt = Date.now();
      timerId = window.setInterval(tick, 200);
    }

    // ── 快捷键（CR-001 / AC-037）：Enter = 开始/再来一次，Escape = 提前结束 ──
    // 焦点在按钮/链接上时不拦截，让原生激活生效（焦点在 Copy link 上按 Enter
    // 必须还是复制，不能被全局快捷键劫持）。CR-002：焦点在选择器 radio 或
    // 粘贴框里时同样不拦——radio 用方向键切换、粘贴框里按 Enter 是换行，
    // 都不能误触测试控制（AC-054）。
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (event: KeyboardEvent) => {
      if (event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || event.altKey || event.shiftKey) return;
      const target = event.target as HTMLElement | null;
      const onActivator =
        target !== null &&
        (target.tagName === 'BUTTON' ||
          target.tagName === 'A' ||
          target.tagName === 'INPUT' ||
          target.tagName === 'TEXTAREA' ||
          target.tagName === 'SELECT');
      if (
        event.key === 'Enter' &&
        !onActivator &&
        (phase === 'idle' || phase === 'shared' || phase === 'done')
      ) {
        event.preventDefault();
        control.click();
      } else if (event.key === 'Escape' && phase === 'running') {
        event.preventDefault();
        finish();
      }
    });

    function tick(): void {
      const elapsed = Date.now() - startedAt;
      setClock(Math.max(0, Math.ceil((duration * 1000 - elapsed) / 1000)));
      if (elapsed >= duration * 1000) finish();
    }

    /** typed 逼近 buffer 末尾时续接下一段（AC-018），计时不中断。
     *  自定义模式：source 只有同一段，续接即循环（AC-043）。 */
    function extendBufferIfNeeded(): void {
      if (!buffer || !needsMoreTarget(buffer.text.length, input.value.length)) return;
      const source = currentSource();
      const next = source[buffer.nextIndex];
      if (next === undefined) return;
      buffer = {
        text: buffer.text + next,
        nextIndex: (buffer.nextIndex + 1) % source.length,
      };
      renderTrack();
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, input.value), input.value.length);
    }

    function finish(): void {
      window.clearInterval(timerId);
      phase = 'done';
      input.disabled = true;
      const elapsed = Math.min(Date.now() - startedAt, duration * 1000);
      setClock(Math.ceil((duration * 1000 - elapsed) / 1000));
      control.textContent = 'Try again';

      const stats = computeStats(buffer?.text ?? '', input.value, elapsed);
      if (!stats.ok) {
        // 无效样本：不结算、不出卡（BR-004），只给一行说明怎么改。
        lastStats = null;
        renderPending(stats.message);
        syncUrl(null);
        updateShareNote();
        return;
      }
      showResult(stats.value);
    }

    function resetToIdle(nextIndex: number): void {
      window.clearInterval(timerId);
      phase = 'idle';
      lastStats = null;

      // 自定义模式还没有有效文本：打字区留空、Start 置灰（AC-040 / AC-051）。
      if (mode === 'custom' && customText === '') {
        currentIndex = 0;
        buffer = null;
        track.replaceChildren();
        spans = [];
        input.value = '';
        input.disabled = true;
        input.maxLength = CUSTOM_TEXT_MAX_CHARS;
        setClock(duration);
        control.textContent = 'Start';
        control.disabled = true;
        renderPending('Paste a text above, then press Start to practice it.');
        syncUrl(null);
        return;
      }

      const source = currentSource();
      const count = source.length;
      currentIndex = mode === 'custom' ? 0 : ((nextIndex % count) + count) % count;
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(source, currentIndex, 1);
      renderTrack();
      input.value = '';
      input.disabled = true;
      input.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      setClock(duration);
      control.textContent = 'Start';
      control.disabled = false;
      renderPending(
        mode === 'custom'
          ? 'Press Start or Enter, then type your text as carefully as you can.'
          : 'Press Start or Enter, then type the text above as carefully as you can.',
      );
      syncUrl(null);
    }

    // ── 三态控制按钮（AC-032：Start / End early / Try again，同一位置）──
    control.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (phase === 'idle' || phase === 'shared') start();
      else if (phase === 'running') finish();
      else resetToIdle(currentIndex + 1);
    });

    // ── 选择器（CR-002 / AC-039 / AC-049）：任何时刻切换都回到初始态 ──
    function setChecked(name: string, value: string): void {
      const radio = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(
        `input[name="${name}"][value="${value}"]`,
      );
      if (radio) radio.checked = true;
    }

    const modeRadios = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="mode"]');
    const tierRadios = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="tier"]');
    const durationRadios = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="duration"]');
    if (modeRadios.length === 0 || tierRadios.length === 0 || durationRadios.length === 0) {
      throw new Error('typing-test: selector radios missing');
    }

    for (const radio of modeRadios) {
      radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
        mode = radio.value === 'custom' ? 'custom' : 'built-in';
        // 难度切换仅内置模式显示（AC-040）；粘贴框仅自定义模式显示。
        tierSelector.hidden = mode === 'custom';
        customPanel.hidden = mode !== 'custom';
        updateShareNote();
        resetToIdle(0);
      });
    }

    for (const radio of tierRadios) {
      radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
        tier = radio.value === 'advanced' ? 'advanced' : 'easy';
        // 换档从该档第 1 段重新开始（AC-042）。
        resetToIdle(0);
      });
    }

    for (const radio of durationRadios) {
      radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
        const parsed = Number(radio.value);
        duration = (DURATIONS as readonly number[]).includes(parsed) ? parsed : DEFAULT_DURATION;
        resetToIdle(currentIndex);
      });
    }

    // ── 自定义文本（CR-002 / AC-041 / AC-050 / AC-051）：清洗 + 就地报错 ──
    textarea.addEventListener('input', () => {
      const result = normalizeCustomText(textarea.value);
      if (result.status === 'ok') {
        customText = result.text;
        errorLine.hidden = true;
      } else {
        customText = '';
        if (result.status === 'too-long') {
          errorLine.textContent =
            `Your text is over the ${CUSTOM_TEXT_MAX_CHARS}-character limit. ` +
            'Shorten it — the limit applies after extra spaces are collapsed.';
          errorLine.hidden = false;
        } else {
          errorLine.hidden = true;
        }
      }
      // 编辑文本 = 改变测试输入：任何时候都回初始态（AC-049 同款语义）。
      resetToIdle(0);
    });

    // ── 输入：字符串即状态，退格/粘贴交给浏览器（AC-004 / 005 / 017）──
    input.addEventListener('input', () => {
      if (phase !== 'running' || !buffer) return;
      extendBufferIfNeeded();
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, input.value), input.value.length);
    });

    // ── Copy link（AC-012）──
    let copyResetTimer = 0;
    function resetCopyLabelLater(): void {
      window.clearTimeout(copyResetTimer);
      copyResetTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
        copyButton.textContent = 'Copy link';
      }, 2000);
    }
    copyButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const write = navigator.clipboard?.writeText(window.location.href);
      if (!write) {
        copyButton.textContent = 'Copying is not available in this browser';
        resetCopyLabelLater();
        return;
      }
      write
        .then(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = 'Link copied';
        })
        .catch(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = 'Copying was blocked — copy the address bar link instead';
        })
        .finally(resetCopyLabelLater);
    });

    // ── Download image（AC-011）：1080×1080 PNG，与预览同一个 drawResultCard ──
    downloadButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!lastStats) return;
      const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
      canvas.width = 1080;
      canvas.height = 1080;
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) {
        downloadButton.textContent = 'Not available in this browser';
        return;
      }
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      drawResultCard(ctx, {
        wpm: String(lastStats.wpm),
        unitLabel: 'words per minute',
        detailLabel: labels.detail,
        rating: ratingFor(lastStats.wpm),
      });
      canvas.toBlob((blob) => {
        if (!blob) {
          downloadButton.textContent = 'Export failed — try again';
          return;
        }
        const link = document.createElement('a');
        link.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        link.download = `typing-${lastStats?.wpm ?? 0}wpm.png`;
        link.click();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(link.href);
      }, 'image/png');
    });

    // ── 分享链接：合法参数 → 直接还原同一张卡（AC-012；CR-002 扩展两种模式）──
    const shared = decodeResult(new URLSearchParams(window.location.search));
    if (shared) {
      phase = 'shared';
      // 旧链接（无 d 字段）回落 60 秒；非法档位回落 easy（BR-009）。
      duration = shared.duration ?? DEFAULT_DURATION;
      if (shared.customText !== undefined) {
        // 自定义模式还原（AC-045）：粘贴框填回原文，可直接再练一遍。
        mode = 'custom';
        customText = shared.customText;
        tierSelector.hidden = true;
        customPanel.hidden = false;
        setChecked('mode', 'custom');
        textarea.value = customText;
        currentIndex = 0;
      } else {
        tier = shared.tier ?? 'easy';
        currentIndex = shared.textIndex ?? 0;
        setChecked('tier', tier);
      }
      setChecked('duration', String(duration));
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(currentSource(), currentIndex, 1);
      passageGroup.setAttribute('data-live', '');
      renderTrack();
      input.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      lastStats = {
        wpm: shared.wpm,
        accuracy: shared.accuracy,
        correct: 0,
        typed: 0,
        seconds: shared.seconds,
      };
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      readoutValue.hidden = false;
      readoutValue.textContent = labels.readout;
      note.hidden = false;
      note.textContent = 'A shared result — press Try it yourself to try your own speed.';
      readout.setAttribute('data-state', 'ok');
      canvas.hidden = false;
      drawCardPreview();
      copyButton.disabled = false;
      downloadButton.disabled = false;
      control.textContent = 'Try it yourself';
      setClock(duration);
      updateShareNote();
    } else {
      resetToIdle(0);
    }
    // JS 接管后隐藏原始段落容器（无 JS 时第一段可见，AC-022）。
    passageGroup.setAttribute('data-live', '');
  }

  // 顶层保护：任何未预期的错误不得导致整页白屏（DESIGN.md §9.3）
  try {
    init();
  } catch {
    // 页面无 JS 时本来就完整可读（渐进增强），这里保持静默
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* 内置段落容器：无 JS 时显示第一段；JS 接管后整组隐藏 */
  .typing-passages[data-live] .typing-passage {
    display: none;
  }

  .typing-passages:not([data-live]) .typing-passage + .typing-passage {
    display: none;
  }

  .typing-passages:not([data-live]) .typing-passage:first-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .typing-stage {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .typing-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* 控制按钮贴着打字区（CR-001）：时钟在左，按钮推到行尾 */
  .typing-meta .btn {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* 倒计时：--text-xl，不是结果读数字号（AC-028，BR-007） */
  .typing-clock {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .typing-hint {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .typing-track-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* 打字区：普通英文句子，自然换行，不留粘贴框感 */
  .typing-track {
    min-height: 7.8em;
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.95;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* 字符 span 由 JS 运行时创建，不带 Astro 的 scoped 属性——必须 :global()，
     否则着色样式全部落空（2026-09-28 浏览器验收实测踩坑） */
  .typing-track :global(span) {
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .typing-track :global(span.is-correct) {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* 错误态双载体：红 + 下划线（DESIGN.md §6-bis.9 第 10 条，AC-004） */
  .typing-track :global(span.is-wrong) {
    color: var(--danger);
    background: var(--danger-wash);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .typing-track :global(span.is-cursor) {
    background: var(--accent-wash);
  }

  /* 原位隐藏输入：opacity 0、盖满打字区、保留可聚焦性；16px 防 iOS 放大（AC-020） */
  .typing-input {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: transparent;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    caret-color: transparent;
  }

  .typing-input:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  /* 结果卡预览：与导出同一个 drawResultCard，正方形（AC-012） */
  .typing-canvas {
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 340px);
    margin: var(--space-4) auto 0;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }

  /* 结果首次出现的 180ms 过渡（AC-031）；prefers-reduced-motion 全局兜底 */
  .readout {
    transition:
      opacity var(--dur-enter) var(--ease-out),
      transform var(--dur-enter) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .readout.is-entering {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(6px);
  }

  /* ── CR-002：选择器行（AC-039）──────────────────────────────────────
     pill 单选：透明 input 铺满整个 pill（触控区 ≥ 44px，AC-056），
     checked / focus 态走兄弟选择器；切换零动效（BR-010）。 */
  .selector-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
  }

  .selector {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .selector[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .selector__label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-right: var(--space-1);
  }

  .chip {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .chip input {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .chip span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .chip input:checked + span {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--accent-wash);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .chip input:focus-visible + span {
    outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ── CR-002：自定义文本粘贴框（AC-040）──────────────────────────── */
  .custom-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .custom-panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .custom-panel__label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .custom-textarea {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 7em;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: var(--text-base); /* iOS 聚焦不放大（BR-010） */
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .custom-textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .field-error {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--danger);
  }

  /* 隐私提示（AC-045）：贴在产物按钮上方 */
  .share-note {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .share-note[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .tool__buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
